OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after getting hit
OL,4,Aby bus on A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,7,Fby a bus on the A14 eastbound near
OL,8,FCambridge.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the road was
OL,11,Fshut between junction 31, the Girton
OL,12,FInterchange for the M11 and the A1307,
OL,13,Fand junction 33 at Milton, following a
OL,14,Fcrash at about 13:40 BST.
OL,16,FIt has since reopened.
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Police, who were leading
OL,19,Fthe response, confirmed a pedestrian
OL,20,Fwas declared dead at the scene. Their
OL,21,Fnext of kin has been informed.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
